@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174/

### GET All Clients

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET Client

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/d8e6b8b2-8fc0-4ac8-b750-2af1779c826a
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET Client with search

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients?search=audi
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### POST Client

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "testtest",
  "email": "a@example.com",
  "phone": "500 600 750",
  "nip": "1234567890"
}

### PUT Client

PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/d8e6b8b2-8fc0-4ac8-b750-2af1779c826a
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "changed",
  "email": "a_new@example.com",
  "phone": "999 888 777",
  "nip": "1234567890"
}

### DELETE Client

DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/clients/8c242132-328c-4358-9f7c-819de32ffa7a
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}